# Reviewer routing for scripts/assign-reviewers.mjs, in CODEOWNERS syntax.
# This is deliberately not a CODEOWNERS file: GitHub requests every matching
# code owner team as soon as a PR opens, before the workflow requests anyone,
# so the whole team gets notified.
#
# Last match wins. Files with no rule (CI, scripts, root config, shared test
# utils, most of packages/core) fall back to @getsentry/team-javascript-sdks.
# Don't add a catch-all `*` rule: it would put the whole team in the codeowner
# pool of every PR and dilute the routing below.

